omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V494xfEKNr0Q7kNvwFtHije&_nc_oc=Ado9J8BHKhr6QdzdWZ7oqyxPXoLtLISxMTvRPXc_RkgxwyInlunN3c0dUYtFvZ54da0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af42WL6WJK_8pVb0s4Lzt8rbMuQ1r5y5AYH54xUnAtOSZg&oe=6A05E8B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=geh7YMaSdYAQ7kNvwHBSSkL&_nc_oc=AdpkAjaWzCEYjKklB__OTrwwPPoDwDptG_cbWSu6KDsAD4sKlevu3YU7pbxdsNrCR8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7dirUHcE50IsvY9i6AD75nH8dchrMJNLAjG1OdAftQ0A&oe=6A05EA16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FxOosb6EfIoQ7kNvwH35TWM&_nc_oc=AdobrGhregzX5gewBVAQhBvcW0xdcgw5x8vnJpYnVuSdiy-gmqdTzTny198-yECvgO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5wMThAPluJhgjWP4GtFi9ZuojT_Xq_rut6V1FIWmntzA&oe=6A05C6F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://